      "side": 1,
      "message": "well the other lanes are real dependencies, we want the values to be merged :)\n\ni also tried a version using 4x normal vector loads + trn to do the permute but this was slower on a55, so this approach was chosen instead. the big cores don\u0027t seem to mind too much beyond that we break the inter-iteration dependency.",
